Subject: [PATCH 139/144] power: supply: add Dodge NU1669 receiver telemetry
 and authorization

Consolidate passive receiver telemetry, binding, authorization and scope changes.

Consolidated from local follow-ups:
  6b3dacc72c76100dadd0985093154b81b0aa74b0 power: supply: add passive NU1669 receiver telemetry on Dodge
  c3a179ea0b3c58c7547d9c4c596b8b5841d239d3 dt-bindings: soc: qcom: describe a wireless receiver power supply
  82b9c42064f3002e353509dd4ce16d9ee2046b7a power: supply: connect receiver presence to wireless power authorization
  bbf66693d8d8c7a25439faab4c85c72468ea71bc power: supply: nu1669: expose raw direct-path firmware state
  36f97c9cca4ea794e8fa3e1f93e21e47aa3f3f84 dt-bindings: soc: qcom: use common supply phandle typing
  20a1549e34f3e9cafc73e1ce19381139ecfd83cb power: supply: scope wireless receiver dependency to battery manager
